{{PCExclusive}}
This article focuses on unimplemented features exclusive to the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC]] version of [[The Battle Cats]]. Note that this article was made long after the discontinuation of Minna de Nyanko Daisensou, and so is likely to be missing much of the unused content that could have been found when it was still playable.

==Unused Sprites and Details==
===Santa Momo & Cat===
The drawstrings on [[Momo (PC Special Cat)|Santa Momo]]'s dress are larger in-battle than they are in her icons.

