===Hatsuyume Mikan===
[[Hatsuyume Mikan (PC Uber Rare Cat)|Hatsuyume Mikan]]'s orange Cat has a stem that can be seen in both of her icons that doesn't appear in-battle, however an unused sprite for it does exist within her spritesheet.

