===Geishun Mikan===
The frond leaflets are shorter and thicker in Geishun Mikan's in-battle appearance compared to how they are in her icons. Another change is that Mikan's hair pins were moved lower, now appearing to be set behind her head instead of in her hair bun. The shine on her bangs also differs between her icons and in-battle appearance.

