===Wise Empress Nobel, Type Σ===
[[Wise Empress Nobel (PC Uber Rare Cat)|Wise Empress Nobel, Type Σ]]'s icons depict three rings at the base of the antennae-like parts of her headphones, something not seen in-battle as they merely use a coloured version of the design seen in her Normal Form. The antennae also appear slightly longer in her Evolved Form's Upgrade Menu icon while her flask is somewhat opaque, but again, neither of those details are reflected in her in-battle appearance.

<gallery hideaddbutton="true" bordercolor="transparent">
Uni10910 c00.png|Wise Empress Nobel, Type Σ's icon
Udi910 c.png|Wise Empress Nobel, Type Σ's Upgrade Menu icon
10910 2.png|Wise Empress Nobel, Type Σ's in-battle appearance
</gallery>

===Odin End===
[[Battle God Odin (PC Uber Rare Cat)|Odin End]]'s horn appears slightly smaller in his icons compared to its size in-battle. The icons also reveal that the tail-end of the swirl design on his helmet ended up being cut short at some point before his release.

